(javazoom/** and org/tritonus/**), so a user can replace them with other versions.
Their source code is available from Maven Central (com.googlecode.soundlibs,
"-sources" jars) and from the links above.

The Japanese speech model (vosk-model-small-ja-0.22) is not part of the jar.
The app downloads it from https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models on the first start.
